# Authorization and Permissions

- Keep shared auth state, policy registration, and permission helpers centralized in `src/lib/authorization.tsx` and `src/utils/permissions.ts`.
- Put feature-specific permission predicates in `src/features/<feature>/permissions/`.
- Add new named policies to `POLICIES` instead of scattering inline checks through routes or components.
- Prefer the existing `Authorization` component and `useCan*`/`useAuth` hooks over ad hoc role checks.
- Keep permission helpers pure; they should not fetch, mutate, or render UI.
